<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>13 / 收尾</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>实施路线图：近期 / 中期 / 远期</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 16 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16, flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center' }}><svg width={1140} height={230} viewBox='0 0 1140 230'><line x1='20' y1='110' x2='1120' y2='110' stroke='#E3E8EF' stroke-width='3'/><circle cx='162' cy='110' r='12' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='162.5' y='112' font-size='13' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>1</text><line x1='162' y1='88' x2='162' y2='90' stroke='#E3E8EF' stroke-width='1'/><text x='162.5' y='62' font-size='17' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>近期</text><text x='162.5' y='86' font-size='14' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>单题引擎打磨 + MCP 只读原型</text><circle cx='447' cy='110' r='12' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='447.5' y='112' font-size='13' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>2</text><line x1='447' y1='132' x2='447' y2='134' stroke='#E3E8EF' stroke-width='1'/><text x='447.5' y='148' font-size='17' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>中期</text><text x='447.5' y='172' font-size='14' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>教师端七项 + 协同 Agent</text><circle cx='732' cy='110' r='12' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='732.5' y='112' font-size='13' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>3</text><line x1='732' y1='88' x2='732' y2='90' stroke='#E3E8EF' stroke-width='1'/><text x='732.5' y='62' font-size='17' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>远期</text><text x='732.5' y='86' font-size='14' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>学校端 + 跨学科试点</text><circle cx='1017' cy='110' r='12' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='1017.5' y='112' font-size='13' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>4</text><line x1='1017' y1='132' x2='1017' y2='134' stroke='#E3E8EF' stroke-width='1'/><text x='1017.5' y='148' font-size='17' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>持续</text><text x='1017.5' y='172' font-size='14' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>自进化闭环与时效更新</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>近期</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>补齐步骤默认难度、出题最低匹配门槛；建立只读查询与受控任务提交的 MCP 原型，在 DSH 与 WorkBuddy 分别验证同一组场景。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>中期</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>教师端备课、批改、出卷改卷落地；协同 Agent 先做学生助教四步，再扩展到教师备课与补练草稿。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>远期</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>学校端质量分析与体系版本治理；选一个边界清晰的小单元做跨学科试点。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 12, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}><Box style={{ width: 8, height: 8, borderRadius: 4, background: '#1E7BE0', marginTop: 9 }} /><Box style={{ flex: 1 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>持续</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#333A45', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>核实案例与知识库 → 提示词、规则和数据修正 → 有明确目标的本地微调 → 经验证后扩大训练或学科范围。</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：全部 12 份设计文档的推进优先级</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 121 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>